					},
					{
						"sceneId": 3,
						"position": [
							-1639.219,
							200.16,
							10051.38
						],
						"pointId": 10424
					},
					{
						"sceneId": 3,
						"position": [
							-1640.835,
							200.051,
							10051.92
						],
						"pointId": 10425
					}
				]
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 751240101,
					"content": "*sigh* It ran off again. Agh, there's only one left inside the swim ring... What do we do now...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751240102
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Jonvelle"
				},
				{
					"id": 751240102,
					"content": "How long is this going to take...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751240103
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Jonvelle"
				},
				{
					"id": 751240103,
					"content": "Huh, looks like someone's taking pictures... of the Flowcurrent Birds here?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751240104
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 751240104,
					"content": "Well, they are pretty cute...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751240105,
						751240107
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 751240105,
					"content": "What with how they sway this way and that...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751240106
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 751240106,
					"content": "Right? They're so cute, bobbing about as they walk. And when they puff up into a ball and float on the water... Ah, that just makes Paimon feel happy.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751240109
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 751240109,
					"content": "That's the spirit, my lovely young lady with the beautifully shiny silver hair! Truly, the one who created these Flowcurrent Birds deserves all the praise this world can offer...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751240110
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Jonvelle"
				},
				{
					"id": 751240110,
					"content": "So great is... Ah, wait, I haven't introduced myself yet. I'm a Flowcurrent Bird photography enthusiast. Call me Jonvelle.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751240111
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Jonvelle"
				},
				{
					"id": 751240111,
					"content": "#Sure! My name's Paimon, and this is {NICKNAME}... Still, why are you sighing sadly over here? Aren't there tons of Flowcurrent Birds around you?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751240112
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 751240112,
					"content": "That's... a long story, but allow me to summarize. There are many just like me, and all of us want to take the most interesting photos...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751240113
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Jonvelle"
				},
				{
					"id": 751240113,
					"content": "And just a few days ago, I came up with an idea most ingenious... That is, to put all the Flowcurrent Birds within my Kamera frame into swim rings!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751240114,
						751240117
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Jonvelle"
				},
				{
					"id": 751240114,
					"content": "And what might be the meaning in that, exactly?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751240115
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 751240115,
					"content": "The meaning, of course, is that it is utterly meaningless. Flowcurrent Birds can swim, and as such, to have them wear those swim rings...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751240116
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Jonvelle"
				},
				{
					"id": 751240116,
					"content": "...Is a thing as devoid of meaning as spending Mora to earn the same amount of Mora back!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751240120
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Jonvelle"
				},
				{
					"id": 751240120,
					"content": "Feels like you're putting too much on their shoulders...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751240121
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 751240121,
					"content": "Indeed, that is what they call \"surrealist photography\" — one must seek deeper meaning within the photo one takes... Though, unfortunately we've run into some trouble on that front.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751240122
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Jonvelle"
				},
				{
					"id": 751240122,
					"content": "As one might expect, real Flowcurrent Birds don't wear swim rings, and so one cannot, in fact, take such pictures...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751240123
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Jonvelle"
				},
				{
					"id": 751240123,
					"content": "You did call it \"surreal,\" you know...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751240124
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 751240124,
					"content": "#Wait. We could just put the swim rings on all the Flowcurrent Birds, couldn't we? C'mon, {NICKNAME}. Let's lend a hand, from two Flowcurrent Bird enthusiasts to another!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751240125,
						751240127
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 751240125,
					"content": "Woohoo, yes, jolly enthusiast cooperation!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751240126
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 751240126,
					"content": "Ex-actly!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751240129
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 751240129,
					"content": "Wait, really? You'd help me out?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751240130
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Jonvelle"
				},
				{
					"id": 751240130,
					"content": "Hehe, as long as you give us a few nice pictures once you're done!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751240131
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 751240131,
					"content": "W—Well then, I'd be in your debt!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Jonvelle"
				},
				{
					"id": 751240127,
					"content": "I prefer Flying Squirrels though...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751240128
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 751240128,
					"content": "Hey, now's not the time for that sort of talk!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751240129
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 751240117,
					"content": "Indeed, this is hardly something a normal person would have considered...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751240118
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 751240118,
					"content": "When Flowcurrent Birds, who can float on water by themselves, wear swim rings, this will create an overflow of layered meaning within the photo.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751240119
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Jonvelle"
				},
				{
					"id": 751240119,
					"content": "Thus, sufficiently embodying both the themes of \"overuse\" and \"waste\"...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751240120
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Jonvelle"
				},
				{
					"id": 751240107,
					"content": "I prefer Flying Squirrels, to be honest...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751240108
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 751240108,
					"content": "Well, they're cute too, but could you really bear to say \"Flying Squirrels are cuter\" right in front of a swimming Flowcurrent Bird's face?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751240109
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				}
			]
		},
